## 📦 Required Package Stack & Re-Planning

To ensure the application feels state-of-the-art, fluid, and responsive, we are integrating the following specialized packages into [`pubspec.yaml`](file:///c:/Users/Khaleelullah/Ryzon-Convert/pubspec.yaml):

| Package Name | Purpose & Utility | Primary Target Flow |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **`flutter_animate`** (`^4.5.0`) | Smooth entrance animations, card slide-ins, pulsing buttons, fade transitions | **All Flows** (1–6) |
| **`lottie`** (`^3.1.2`) | Vector animations for success badges, pending spinners & splash screens | **Flow 1, 3, 4, 5** |
| **`shimmer`** (`^3.0.0`) | Shimmering skeleton loaders for transaction history, cards & bank lists | **Flow 2, 4** |
| **`infinite_scroll_pagination`** (`^4.0.0`) | Page-by-page infinite scrolling for history, notifications & bank selection | **Flow 2, 4, 6** |
| **`smooth_page_indicator`** (`^1.1.0`) | Animated dot indicators for onboarding slides | **Flow 1** |
| **`share_plus`** (`^9.0.0`) | Native sheet sharing of deposit addresses, receipts & referral codes | **Flow 3, 6** |
| **`flutter_secure_storage`** (`^9.2.2`) | Encrypted storage for session tokens, PIN flags & biometric preferences | **Flow 1, 6** |
| **`google_fonts`** (`^6.2.1`) | Global `Outfit` font family across all typography styles | **All Flows** (1–6) |

